WEBVTT

33:31.160 --> 33:34.789
Who was your first kill,
not counting old men?

33:36.124 --> 33:38.668
One of the outlaws
in the brotherhood.

33:38.793 --> 33:41.296
I was there that day.

33:41.421 --> 33:44.465
You were only a squire, 16 years old.

33:44.591 --> 33:47.427
You killed Simon Toyne
with a counter riposte.

33:47.552 --> 33:49.679
Best move I ever saw.

33:49.804 --> 33:54.058
A good fighter, Toyne,
but he lacked stamina.

33:54.183 --> 33:56.311
Your outlaw...

33:57.353 --> 33:58.855
any last words?

33:58.980 --> 34:01.691
- I cut his head off, so no.
- Hmm.
